<v Trevar>All right.

00:31:01.290 --> 00:31:02.190
<v Zack McDermott>No, no.

00:31:02.190 --> 00:31:04.370
<v Trevar>Well, I'm not rubbing hard. I'm not rubbing hard.

00:31:04.370 --> 00:31:05.440
<v Zack McDermott>No, I mean-- all right.

