<v Trevar>I'm just rubbing it around.

00:31:05.890 --> 00:31:07.480
<v Zack McDermott>Good. We're fine. Yeah.

00:31:07.480 --> 00:31:09.090
<v Trevar>Yeah. Lower. There you go.

